[
  {
    "index": 0,
    "text": "Lesson 69 The car race",
    "start": 0.971,
    "end": 5.232,
    "zh": "第69课 汽车比赛",
    "zh_hant": "第69課 汽車比賽"
  },
  {
    "index": 1,
    "text": "Listen to the tape then",
    "start": 6.253,
    "end": 9.154,
    "zh": "听录音，然后",
    "zh_hant": "聽錄音，然後"
  },
  {
    "index": 2,
    "text": "answer this question.",
    "start": 8.995,
    "end": 10.915,
    "zh": "回答这个问题。",
    "zh_hant": "回答這個問題。"
  },
  {
    "index": 3,
    "text": "Which car was the winner in 1995?",
    "start": 12.096,
    "end": 18.67,
    "zh": "1995年哪辆车赢得了比赛？",
    "zh_hant": "1995年哪輛車贏得了比賽？"
  },
  {
    "index": 4,
    "text": "There is a car race near our town",
    "start": 19.16,
    "end": 23.362,
    "zh": "在我们城镇附近有一场汽车比赛",
    "zh_hant": "在我們城鎮附近有一場汽車比賽"
  },
  {
    "index": 5,
    "text": "every year.",
    "start": 23.222,
    "end": 24.642,
    "zh": "每年举行。",
    "zh_hant": "每年舉行。"
  },
  {
    "index": 6,
    "text": "In 1995,",
    "start": 25.343,
    "end": 28.274,
    "zh": "在1995年",
    "zh_hant": "在1995年"
  },
  {
    "index": 7,
    "text": "there was a very big race.",
    "start": 28.324,
    "end": 31.526,
    "zh": "有一场非常大的比赛。",
    "zh_hant": "有一場非常大的比賽。"
  },
  {
    "index": 8,
    "text": "There were hundreds of people there.",
    "start": 32.186,
    "end": 35.408,
    "zh": "那里有数百人。",
    "zh_hant": "那裡有數百人。"
  },
  {
    "index": 9,
    "text": "My wife and I were at the race.",
    "start": 35.988,
    "end": 39.65,
    "zh": "我和妻子都在比赛现场。",
    "zh_hant": "我和妻子都在比賽現場。"
  },
  {
    "index": 10,
    "text": "Our friends Julie and Jack were there, too.",
    "start": 40.291,
    "end": 44.753,
    "zh": "我们的朋友朱莉和杰克也在那里。",
    "zh_hant": "我們的朋友朱莉和傑克也在那裡。"
  },
  {
    "index": 11,
    "text": "You can see us in the crowd.",
    "start": 45.573,
    "end": 48.775,
    "zh": "你可以在人群中看到我们。",
    "zh_hant": "你可以在人群中看到我們。"
  },
  {
    "index": 12,
    "text": "We are standing on the left.",
    "start": 49.415,
    "end": 52.717,
    "zh": "我们站在左边。",
    "zh_hant": "我們站在左邊。"
  },
  {
    "index": 13,
    "text": "There were twenty cars in the race.",
    "start": 53.937,
    "end": 57.719,
    "zh": "比赛中有二十辆车。",
    "zh_hant": "比賽中有二十輛車。"
  },
  {
    "index": 14,
    "text": "There were English cars, French cars,",
    "start": 58.2,
    "end": 62.261,
    "zh": "有英国车、法国车",
    "zh_hant": "有英國車、法國車"
  },
  {
    "index": 15,
    "text": "German cars, Italian cars,",
    "start": 62.482,
    "end": 66.103,
    "zh": "德国车、意大利车",
    "zh_hant": "德國車、義大利車"
  },
  {
    "index": 16,
    "text": "American cars and Japanese",
    "start": 66.424,
    "end": 70.446,
    "zh": "美国车和日本",
    "zh_hant": "美國車和日本"
  },
  {
    "index": 17,
    "text": "cars.",
    "start": 70.096,
    "end": 71.046,
    "zh": "车。",
    "zh_hant": "車。"
  },
  {
    "index": 18,
    "text": "It was an exciting finish.",
    "start": 71.847,
    "end": 74.988,
    "zh": "那是一个激动人心的结尾。",
    "zh_hant": "那是一個激動人心的結尾。"
  },
  {
    "index": 19,
    "text": "The winner was Billy Stewart.",
    "start": 75.708,
    "end": 78.61,
    "zh": "获胜者是比利·斯图尔特。",
    "zh_hant": "獲勝者是比利·斯圖爾特。"
  },
  {
    "index": 20,
    "text": "He was in car number",
    "start": 78.26,
    "end": 81.873,
    "zh": "他开的是车号",
    "zh_hant": "他開的是車號"
  },
  {
    "index": 21,
    "text": "fifteen.",
    "start": 81.574,
    "end": 82.834,
    "zh": "十五。",
    "zh_hant": "十五。"
  },
  {
    "index": 22,
    "text": "Five other cars were just behind him.",
    "start": 83.555,
    "end": 87.779,
    "zh": "其他五辆车紧跟在他后面。",
    "zh_hant": "其他五輛車緊跟在他後面。"
  },
  {
    "index": 23,
    "text": "On the way home,",
    "start": 89.06,
    "end": 90.782,
    "zh": "在回家的路上",
    "zh_hant": "在回家的路上"
  },
  {
    "index": 24,
    "text": "my wife said to me,",
    "start": 91.002,
    "end": 93.204,
    "zh": "我妻子对我说",
    "zh_hant": "我妻子對我說"
  },
  {
    "index": 25,
    "text": "'Don't drive so quickly!",
    "start": 94.285,
    "end": 97.067,
    "zh": "“别开这么快！",
    "zh_hant": "“別開這麼快！"
  },
  {
    "index": 26,
    "text": "You're not Billy Stewart!'",
    "start": 97.328,
    "end": 99.89,
    "zh": "你不是比利·斯图尔特！”",
    "zh_hant": "你不是比利·斯圖爾特！”"
  }
]
